Derived files:

- resources/jitex/tangle.pas is the Pascal program produced by tangle from
  tangle.web. It is renamed, as the license requires.
- resources/jitex/trip.ch is Knuth's change file for the TRIP test.
- The compiled TeX output and the other generated files in this tree are
  derived from the sources above; if modified they must not reuse the
  original file names.
